{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49725","headline":"虞美人 二 · 孙光宪","name":"虞美人 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"好风微揭帘旌起，金翼鸾相倚。\n翠檐愁听乳禽声，此时春态暗关情，独难平。\n画堂流水空相翳，一穗香摇曳。\n教人无处寄相思，落花芳草过前期，没人知。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孙光宪","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49725.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49725","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}